              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Free Energy"
              },
              {
                "text": " and use the My Response link below to ask any questions you might have about the material that you would like the instructor to address. Your questions can be for clarification of the material or further insight. Your self-evaluation and questions may also shape the discussions in class."
              }
            ],
            "id": "062tg1fi7hbnc9a",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Your responses will not be graded but will be available for your instructor."
